      hu: "Régészeti lelőhely, amely ősi kolumbusz előtti, sziklákba vésett petroglifákat tartalmaz.",
      ro: "Un sit arheologic cu petroglife antice precolumbiene sculptate în stânci.",
      en: "An archaeological site featuring ancient pre-Columbian petroglyphs carved into rocks."
